   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WATED was registered in September 2013 under the Ministry of
Health Community Development Gender Elderly and Children with
registration number 00006546. All founding members identified prior
to attending the Leadership Training in United States for the studies of
Legal &#x2013; access to justice and legal information to rural communities;
Health issues to rural communities; participation ongoing projects to
members of the public. By believing in giving back to the community
founding members came up with the idea of having an organization
that will empower community specifically women and girls at the
aspect of leadership, life skills, and human right defenders. From the
needs identified holistically we agreed to approach our programs and
activities based on our expertise and to bank on partnership with
existing local, regional and international organizations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Action Towards Economic</narrative>
